                            <p id=3D"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0020.tlg002:814"><=
b>=C2=A7 814</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;Again, few know that the twenty-seventh of the =
month is best for opening a wine-jar, and putting yokes on the necks of <a =
