b>=C2=A7 819</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;On the fourth day open a jar. The fourth of the=
 mid-month is a day holy above all. And again, few men know that the fourth=
 day after the twentieth is best while it is morning: towards evening it is=
 less good. </p>                        </div>
